{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">網絡瘋傳一段車Cam影片，事發於北角街市對出路段。車Cam車主當時正向右轉灣，不料前方突有一名疑似家長的身影，帶著兩名幼童直接闖入行車道胡亂過馬路。當三人發現有車駛近時，才及時急停，險些釀成意外。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-13h53m56s550.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Tl6lnjEFbl1791439204.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-13h53m56s550.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-13h54m00s921.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026t4tyA0VZhp1791439212.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-08-13h54m00s921.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">樓主將影片分享至網絡並爆料指出：「呢位慈父已經唔係第一次咁樣同仔過馬路，遲早一鑊。」</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\"> </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">片段引發大批網民圍觀及爆眼怒轟，眾人紛紛對該名家長忽視幼童安全的行為表達強烈不滿：</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">怒轟身教失敗派：大批網民直指該男子做出不良示範，留言怒斥「大教壞細」，並提醒：「行多幾步有紅綠燈」、「貪方便遲早出事」，更有網民建議：「同佢學校講聲 小心啲」。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left\">酸爆打趣派：亦有眼尖網民根據地點打趣留言：「無問題喎 健康邨丫麻 一定健康」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T06:39:27.576237+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}